<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Armstrong World lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Armstrong World lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on the shares of Armstrong World Industries Inc to an outperform from a strong buy.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Armstrong stock added 5/16 to 68-7/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
